# DJ01: the LFO page with the added waves. MOD page, LFO 1: FUNC + turn E left (WAVE to its default, 1, SINE), then WAVE
# (encoder E) up one detent at a time, 18 detents (past OCTA, 15, to show the top holds), a screen after each; on DV-F
# (back down to it) MODE
# (G) through its five places and SPH (F) to 0, 64, 127 and back; then LFO 2 (DOWN) WAVE up 9 detents and LFO 3
# (DOWN) 16 detents; each screen's drawn texts (t63b_live) show WAVE's text, MODE's words and SPH's label.
